# r1106spf b2s: literal coordinates (zq count takes no ~), entity census at the plains.
pace 1

## SQ-SPF-73 | wild crops around the plains (literal box)
> forceload add 3696 3376 3776 3456
sleep 10
> zq count 3696 -64 3376 3776 200 3456 farmersdelight:wild_carrots
> zq count 3696 -64 3376 3776 200 3456 farmersdelight:wild_cabbages
> zq count 3696 -64 3376 3776 200 3456 farmersdelight:wild_onions
> zq count 3696 -64 3376 3776 200 3456 farmersdelight:wild_potatoes
> zq count 3696 -64 3376 3776 200 3456 farmersdelight:wild_beetroots
> zq count 3696 -64 3376 3776 200 3456 minecraft:grass
look wild crops above 0 (grass > 0 shows the box scanned)

## SQ-NM-01 | animal census at the plains
> execute at qa if entity @e[distance=..200,type=!minecraft:player]
> execute at qa if entity @e[distance=..200,type=minecraft:cow]
> execute at qa if entity @e[distance=..200,type=minecraft:sheep]
> execute at qa if entity @e[distance=..200,type=minecraft:pig]
> execute at qa if entity @e[distance=..200,type=minecraft:chicken]
> execute at qa if entity @e[distance=..200,type=#zq:monsters]
> data get entity qa Pos
> forceload remove 3696 3376 3776 3456
look counts per type (Test passed, count N / Test failed)
